      "tag": "p",
      "classes": [
        "drama"
      ],
      "text": "MESSENGER.\nThe sum of all I can, I have disclosed.\nWhy or for what the nobles were committed\nIs all unknown to me, my gracious lord.",
      "separatorAfter": "\n\n",
      "spans": [],
      "lines": [
